    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emma:\u00a0</strong><i>\u201cThe battle for survival begins now, Commander.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mechxis War</i> is an action-packed RPG set in a future where Earth is under siege by alien AI Enemies. Humanity\u2019s hope rests on your shoulders, as the pilot and commander of <strong>AlphaRobo</strong>, an advanced mech warrior built to change the course of this war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for battle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Tactical-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Command AlphaRobo with precision and strategy. Outmaneuver enemy forces and turn the tide of battle with your superior combat skills.<br>\u2714 <strong>Deep Progression System</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your mech, unlock devastating abilities, and tailor your combat style to face ever-growing threats.<br>\u2714 <strong>Epic Sci-Fi Story</strong> \u2013 Defend Earth, venture into space, and uncover the hidden truth behind the alien invasion. The fight for survival is just the beginning.<br>\u2714 <strong>32+ Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Fight across 32+ diverse levels, each presenting new challenges, environments, and ruthless enemies to overcome.<br>\u2714 <strong>20+ Intense Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Prepare yourself for massive robotic bosses that demand strategy, skill, and determination to defeat. Each one is a unique challenge, and only the strongest will prevail.<br>\u2714 <strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 Take on different combat styles, discover hidden upgrades, and conquer the many obstacles ahead as the war intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAre you ready to lead the resistance, Commander? Humanity\u2019s future is in your hands.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>Mechxis War</i> on Steam now and be the first to answer the call. Earth\u2019s fate depends on you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emma:\u00a0</strong><i>\u201cThe battle for survival begins now, Commander.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mechxis War</i> is an action-packed RPG set in a future where Earth is under siege by alien AI Enemies. Humanity\u2019s hope rests on your shoulders, as the pilot and commander of <strong>AlphaRobo</strong>, an advanced mech warrior built to change the course of this war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare for battle:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Tactical-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Command AlphaRobo with precision and strategy. Outmaneuver enemy forces and turn the tide of battle with your superior combat skills.<br>\u2714 <strong>Deep Progression System</strong> \u2013 Upgrade your mech, unlock devastating abilities, and tailor your combat style to face ever-growing threats.<br>\u2714 <strong>Epic Sci-Fi Story</strong> \u2013 Defend Earth, venture into space, and uncover the hidden truth behind the alien invasion. The fight for survival is just the beginning.<br>\u2714 <strong>32+ Unique Levels</strong> \u2013 Fight across 32+ diverse levels, each presenting new challenges, environments, and ruthless enemies to overcome.<br>\u2714 <strong>20+ Intense Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Prepare yourself for massive robotic bosses that demand strategy, skill, and determination to defeat. Each one is a unique challenge, and only the strongest will prevail.<br>\u2714 <strong>Endless Replayability</strong> \u2013 Take on different combat styles, discover hidden upgrades, and conquer the many obstacles ahead as the war intensifies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAre you ready to lead the resistance, Commander? Humanity\u2019s future is in your hands.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist <i>Mechxis War</i> on Steam now and be the first to answer the call. Earth\u2019s fate depends on you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Emma: &quot;Humanity stands on the edge of extinction. As the commander of AlphaRobo, Earth\u2019s ultimate war machine, you\u2019re our final defense. The rogue AI is back, stronger than ever. Upgrade your mech, unlock powerful abilities, and lead the charge to save us all. We are waiting for you, Commander.&quot;",
